          {
            "/": "/login",
            "#": "token_hash=*&type=*",
            "comment": "Magic-link / recovery hop - open directly in REPS. The '#' matcher is load-bearing, not cosmetic: it keeps iOS from handing a bare/tokenless /login to the app, which isAuthCallbackPath() would accept and then route to the magic-link error screen. Loosening it means narrowing that gate in the same change. Scoped to /login only - never '/' (marketing) or '/r/:slug' (resolver)."
          }
        ]
      },
